<title>PERU: Strong tremor shakes Peru, no damage reported.</title>
<headline>Strong tremor shakes Peru, no damage reported.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA, Peru 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A strong tremor shook Peru on Tuesday, but no damage was immediately reported.</p>
<p>The tremor, at 6:10 p.m. (1110 GMT), was felt along Peru's Pacific coast, including Lima, for about a minute.</p>
<p>There was no immediate word on the magnitude or epicentre of the tremor.</p>
